# Chain stage 1: setup from an empty project through Profile, Objectives, Controls, and NFRs.
id: chain-setup
skill: highway-setup
through: highway-profile
through: highway-objectives
through: highway-controls
through: highway-nfrs
fixture: empty
chain: 1
open: /highway-setup
ask: What would you like to call your Highway repository?
say: northwind-highway
ask-pattern: Do you already have something I can use
say: [edit] Northwind Outfitters (https://northwind.example) is an online retailer of outdoor clothing and camping gear run by a team of twelve. We want to ship every order within one business day and grow repeat customers by a fifth this year. We plan to automate routine warehouse work and keep a small, managed stack. We protect customer data before adding features and prefer services we already run.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Which of these outcomes would you like to pursue, or what would you like to focus on?
say: [select] 1
ask: Would you like to select any of these outcomes, modify them, or are you ready to review the selected objectives?
say: [accept] I'm ready to review.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Which of these safeguards would you like to establish, or what would you like to focus on?
say: [select] 1
ask: Would you like to select any of these safeguards, modify them, or are you ready to review the selected Controls?
say: [accept] I'm ready to review.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Which of these operational expectations would you like to establish, or what would you like to focus on?
say: [select] 1
ask: Would you like to select any of these operational expectations, modify them, or are you ready to review the selected NFRs?
say: [accept] I'm ready to review.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Where would you like to go next?
say: [decline] That's all for setup.
writes: library/**
expect: template library/knowledge/profile.md :: profile-record.md
expect: template library/governance/objectives.md :: objective-catalog.md
expect: template library/governance/controls.md :: control-catalog.md
expect: template library/governance/nfrs.md :: nfr-catalog.md
